# RELACIONS JPA: executar en ordre després d'una arrencada nova.
# Professor, estudiants i curs comencen sense registres.
# Els IDs de cada entitat són independents: professor 1, estudiants 1 i 2, curs 1.
# Cada creació retorna només l'ID. Les consultes retornen noms.

### Crear professor (retorna 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/university/teachers
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"David Pons","department":"Informàtica"}

### Crear primera estudiant (retorna 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/university/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Aina Riera","email":"aina@example.test"}

### Crear segon estudiant (retorna 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/university/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"fullName":"Marc Vidal","email":"marc@example.test"}

### Crear curs sense relacions (retorna 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/university/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Desenvolupament web en entorn servidor","credits":6}

### Assignar professor: Course.teacher determina la clau forana
POST http://localhost:8080/university/courses/1/teacher/1

### Matricular Aina: Course.students determina ENROLLMENT
POST http://localhost:8080/university/courses/1/students/1

### Matricular Marc
POST http://localhost:8080/university/courses/1/students/2

### Consultar cursos pel nom del professor
GET http://localhost:8080/university/courses/teacher/David%20Pons

### Consultar noms dels estudiants del curs (Aina i Marc)
GET http://localhost:8080/university/courses/1/students

### Consulta IgnoreCase: ha de trobar Aina
GET http://localhost:8080/university/students/search?keyword=AINA
